ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e6935944-0acd-5593-aa80-e56f6014c13f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124342"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-124148"] :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/assets/2400f92070b4f7d4e0ad0309574b729da86754bc64b6d7a3c508433d1bbc7f76.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C$ is the path along the line segment between the points $(4,0)$ to the point $(0,3),$ as shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{2}=3$ and ${y}_{1}=0.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=3-0=3.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-124149"] :question/problem "If ${\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=4$ and ${\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=6,$ calculate ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $x,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4-6 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection/1b9761d437e98dd374daf86a09146d91bc3b1036c06a1f6466d61824390fba31" :answer/id #uuid "415ade7c-5a79-5492-8a50-edeb6668ef2d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Impossible to determine" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "6c8ea61d-2dbd-596b-b490-02cd5e36e379" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "124f71fe-c3d9-5275-a02a-e7bffd254773" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "517cd13b-7ef6-5860-b60e-44c0abcc4846" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "36787f21-988e-5c12-adf1-a110a30b1108" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8d8443e6-8d4d-5286-89ef-37939581c384" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-124179/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-124179/selection/1b9761d437e98dd374daf86a09146d91bc3b1036c06a1f6466d61824390fba31" "q-124179/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-124179/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" "q-124179/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-124179/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-124179" :question/id #uuid "91767182-155c-5640-b85b-b94d940de243" :question/math-academy-id "q-124179" :question/problem "If ${\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=3$ and ${\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=5,$ calculate ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $y,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-3+5 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-124179/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2fd19952-77af-5f27-a7ef-adf46b1958ae"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124179"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-124182/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "bd450cd9-2ebd-5452-a140-d51507db6af9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124182/selection/1b9761d437e98dd374daf86a09146d91bc3b1036c06a1f6466d61824390fba31" :answer/id #uuid "9e69d300-5705-5fcf-b1de-4c07ba633fe6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Impossible to determine" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124182/selection/f3